     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Following questions is that how can do if I have more samples? In this vignette (<a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Faroma-project.org%2Fvignettes%2FPairedPSCBS-lowlevel%2F&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNFzc80yu6yyzSNNlmQZmIPYNymAFQ\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(209,72,54)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.google.com/url?q%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Faroma-project.org%252Fvignettes%252FPairedPSCBS-lowlevel%252F%26sa%3DD%26sntz%3D1%26usg%3DAFQjCNFzc80yu6yyzSNNlmQZmIPYNymAFQ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230307486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18AyqnBcLViXURjZzcbra4\">http://aroma-project.org/vignettes/PairedPSCBS-lowlevel/</a>)  one pair of samples were used. What if I have more than one pairs? Because I could not list all the file names in the<span style=\"background-color:rgb(153,153,153)\"> <span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">pair</span><span style=\"color:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:inherit;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(153,0,115)\">T</span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-b