"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;N&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">]</span><span style=\"font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857143;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit\"><font color=\"#000000\">) so that multiple pairs are supported?</font></span></font></div>"
